sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Desarrollador
    participant GitHub as GitHub Repository
    participant Actions as GitHub Actions (3 Pipelines)
    participant ECR as Amazon ECR
    participant EC2 as Amazon EC2 (SSM)

    Dev->>GitHub: git push origin deploy
    GitHub->>Actions: Trigger workflows on 'deploy' branch
    
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Actions: Fase de Build (Maven/Node)
        Actions->>Actions: Checkout source code
        Actions->>Actions: Configure AWS Credentials
        Actions->>Actions: docker build (Multi-stage)
        Actions->>Actions: docker tag para Amazon ECR
    end
    
    rect rgb(220, 240, 200)
        Note over Actions,ECR: Fase de Push Registries
        Actions->>ECR: Login to Amazon ECR
        Actions->>ECR: docker push image (frontend, ventas, despachos)
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 220, 200)
        Note over Actions,EC2: Fase de Despliegue Automatizado
        Actions->>EC2: aws ssm send-command
        EC2->>EC2: git pull origin deploy
        EC2->>ECR: Inject Variables (FRONTEND_IMAGE, etc)
        EC2->>EC2: docker compose pull && up -d
    end
    
    EC2-->>Dev: Microservicios Actualizados
